{"author":{"id":"746a4d30afc20b78119cb8ed7c194f988174fc252f0e9d9eb92022244ef86db3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1777639223,"nonce":"SYlo0deXICHDNQZuaRP5rJnxJCI=","metadata":{"github-id":"I_kwDOK4fCvM8AAAABBCN43Q","github-url":"https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/120","origin":"github"},"title":"IzzyBoat: parity tracker — fixes pending migration from BizzyBoat","message":"## Goal\n\nRunning checklist of fixes applied to BizzyBoat that should also be applied\nto IzzyBoat, to be migrated in a single batch when IzzyBoat is next accessible.\n\n## Background\n\nBizzyBoat is iterating quickly in the run-up to the June 2026 hydrography\nclass. IzzyBoat gets less hands-on time, so bizzy-only changes accumulate.\nRather than tracking each as its own issue and forgetting them, this issue\nis the umbrella; one PR will migrate the lot.\n\n## Process\n\n- Add a new entry under \"Pending migrations\" each time a bizzy-side fix is\n  identified that needs to land on IzzyBoat too.\n- Include: source PR/commit, problem, fix, izzy-specific notes.\n- When IzzyBoat is accessible, open a single PR that closes this issue.\n\n## Pending migrations\n\n### 1. mavros `local_position` / `global_position` `child_frame_id`\n\n- **Source**: PR #98 (commit d40845e)\n- **Problem**: mavros's `local_position` plugin defaults `child_frame_id`\n  to bare `base_link` when not set explicitly. In a namespaced TF tree\n  (`izzy/...`), this produces topics with `header.frame_id: base_link`\n  that no consumer can resolve — every sample dropped silently.\n- **Fix**: set `child_frame_id: \"izzy/base_link\"` alongside `frame_id`\n  in the `local_position` and `global_position` blocks of IzzyBoat's\n  mavros config. The `imu` plugin only takes `frame_id` and is\n  unaffected.\n- **Izzy-specific note**: IzzyBoat has no `bizzyboat_project11`-style\n  `mavros.yaml`. First sub-task is to locate where mavros is launched\n  for izzy and what config (if any) it loads.\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: Claude Code Agent\n**Model**: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context)","files":null}]}